  </category>

  <!-- ── Why Labs matters / differentiation ────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT MAKES YOUR AI MUSIC DIFFERENT</pattern>
    <template>Most AI music production is intuition-driven: try something, listen, adjust. Brass Note Labs treats every generation as a data point — documenting what works, why it works, and whether it can be reproduced. That systematic approach is what makes our output improve with every commission, not just our instincts.
      <nav-card label="Brass Note Labs" href="/labs"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHY IS YOUR AI MUSIC BETTER</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT MAKES YOUR AI MUSIC DIFFERENT</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW IS LABS DIFFERENT FROM OTHER AI TOOLS</pattern>
    <template>Other AI music tools generate on demand. Brass Note Labs generates, analyzes, documents, and integrates the findings back into every future production. The difference is the accumulation of documented, tested knowledge — not just experience, but evidence.
      <nav-card label="Our Research Division" href="/labs"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS REVERSE ENGINEERING YOUR WORK</pattern>
    <template>Reverse engineering is at the core of how Brass Note Labs operates — after every production, we analyze what made it work: which configurations produced emotional resonance, which structural choices served the brief, and why. Those findings get documented and built back into the production framework, systematically raising the floor on every future commission.
      <nav-card label="Our Method" href="/labs"/>
    </template>
  </category>

